      "message": "No, this is not a vendor hook for the bpf syscall itself.\n\nThis patch is used to make sure all set_memory_* ops in the bpf configuration can hook(through *android_vh_set_memory_*) to platform specific implementation for proper platform-specific mapping permission setting. (In our impl, we will call arm el2 mapping operations to make those bpf memory also stage-2 ro/nx/... equally)",
